<title>JAPAN: Atsugi Nylon -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Atsugi Nylon -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 21.86		vs	   22.21</p>
<p> Operating	  140    million	  vs	   38    million</p>
<p> Current	    346    million	  vs	  270    million</p>
<p> Net		  126    million	  vs	  150    million</p>
<p> EPS		    1.28 yen	  vs	    1.52 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     99 million	  vs	  99 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Atsugi Nylon Shoji Co Ltd is a leading pantyhose sales firm.</p>
</text>
